#70208
"The Tower Garden"
"The treacherous stairs end here with a strange and beautiful garden.  At

your feet there are small, carved trenches in the stone floor, through

which water flows.  Small potted plants sit in these trenches, making an

effective automatic watering system.  Yellow vines climb the walls,

flowers growing along them.

"
"B1

An underground stream flows into the castle through here and exits into the

sewers.  All of the plants thrive in darkness, including a special kind of

rose that glows faintly but the light fades shortly after picking.

