#70226
"The Attic"
"This room looks like it might have been used for storage sometime long,

long ago but was forgotten shortly after it was filled with unwanted

furniture and things.  Someone has obviously rediscovered this room more

recently, newer additions piled on top of the old.  Most of a chess set

is scattered around on tables and shelves and an old china doll lies in

the corner, a hole broken into it's skull.  An unstable looking wooden

ladder stands in the middle of the attic, leading up to a small looking

platform.  A small cupboard-like door sits in the south wall, close to

the floor.

"
"Princess's secret room - search to find item stuff

Extras: ladder/unstable/wooden

